WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.545
Today is the habit the whole plan is built on. Read it, see it.

2
00:00:03.995 --> 00:00:06.574
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.074 --> 00:00:10.861
Your child reads the sentence out loud. Then reads it once more.

4
00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.914
A cat sat on a big box.

5
00:00:13.614 --> 00:00:17.130
The first read is for the words. The second read is for the meaning.

6
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.733
Now say: close your eyes. Make a picture of it in your head. What do you see?

7
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:25.237
Ask two things. Who is in your picture? And where?

8
00:00:25.687 --> 00:00:29.915
If something is missing, do not tell. Say: read it again. What do you see?

9
00:00:30.365 --> 00:00:32.250
Then your child draws it in the box.

10
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:38.614
The drawing shows you what was understood, with no talking needed. It does not have to be a good drawing.

11
00:00:39.064 --> 00:00:43.269
A cat beside a small box tells you something. So does a cat on a big one.

12
00:00:43.719 --> 00:00:48.930
Job two is for your child alone. Two more sentences, each with a box to draw in.

13
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:55.134
At the end, your child shows you the pictures, reads three words, and points to each one in the drawings.
